-- Corrections of five KpopQuizz Team quizzes, and MAMAMOO Curtain Call to draft (owner decisions of 2026-10-27).
-- OWNER-GATED: pasted by the owner in the Supabase SQL editor, then checked by Claude. Paste it AFTER
-- seo-explanations-e1.sql (it updates four of those explanations). Rollback: quiz-team-fixes-2026-10-27-rollback.sql.
-- Proof of every change: quiz-team-fixes-2026-10-27.md (one section per question, before, after, why and source).
-- What changes: the questions of five quizzes (gi-dle-the-tomboy-era, 4th-gen-groups-true-or-false,
-- k-pop-streaming-records, bts-music-video-trivia-can-you-get-100, twice-members-facts-quiz) and of their bank rows
-- when they have one (same text, a source per question, new bank notes); mamamoo-the-curtain-call-era goes to draft
-- (it is built on an album that does not exist; a checked rewrite comes later). Same number of questions, same order,
-- the right answer at the same position (4th gen Q3 is now marked False: its statement is false).
-- Nothing else: not the titles, the counters, the slugs or updated_at.
-- Guard: every row must hold the content read in production on 2026-10-27 (md5), else nothing changes; after the
-- updates every row must hold the corrected content (md5). Running it twice fails on the guard.

